Comments:
    A cool blob of material falling in a stratified background. Gravity points in the direction of increasing depth. Stratification is controlled by cs0.
    
    The thermal should reach the bottom of the box at about t=40.
    
    The main purpose of this sample is to test special/dampuu.f90. When the damping is turned off (e.g. set tau>>1) and one runs till, say, t=5, one sees clear horizontal stripes in contour plots of the pressure perturbation (plot_pressure_pert.py). These striations are well developed even at t=5

